  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div id=\"main\" role=\"main\" data-page-type=\"overview\"> <div data-analytics-section-engagement=\"name:hero\"> <h2> <span>WWDC26</span> </h2> <div> <p>New Siri AI powered by Apple&nbsp;Intelligence. Expanded child&nbsp;safety features. And&nbsp;helpful updates all around.</p> <p>Coming later this year</p> <div> <p>Video replay of today’s event will&nbsp;be&nbsp;available&nbsp;shortly.</p> <p>Video replay of today’s event will&nbsp;be&nbsp;available&nbsp;shortly.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div> <h2>Here’s what we announced.</h2> <div> <div data-analytics-section-engagement=\"name:siri ai\"> <div> <picture id=\"overview-announced-siri-1\" data-lazy=\"\"> <source data-empty=\"\" srcset=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" media=\"(min-width:0px)\"> <img src=\"https://www.apple.com/v/apple-events/home/aj/images/overview/announced/siri__fvnql0etk9m6_large.jpg\" onload=\"window.__lp?.(event)\" alt=\"Static of Siri AI in use in Dynamic Island in iPhone 17 Pro\"> </picture> </div> <div> <h3>All-new Siri AI. Truly&nbsp;helpful. Truly&nbsp;yours.</h3> <p>Siri AI powered by Apple&nbsp;Intelligence is more helpful than ever, with richer answers, natural conversations, and a new, dedicated app.<sup><a href=\"#footnote-1\" aria-label=\"Footnote 1\" data-modal-close=\"\">1</a></sup></p> </div> </div> <div data-analytics-section-engagement=\"name:apple intelligence\"> <div> <picture id=\"overview-announced-apple-intelligence-1\" data-lazy=\"\"> <source data-empty=\"\" srcset=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" media=\"(min-width:0px)\"> <img src=\"https://www.apple.com/v/apple-events/home/aj/images/overview/announced/apple_intelligence__bk6as4gq9m02_large.jpg\" onload=\"window.__lp?.(event)\" alt=\"Siri AI displaying visuals of glass vases on iPad 11 Pro, and text about sports equipment on iPhone 17 Pro.\"> </picture> </div> <div> <h3>Apple Intelligence in more apps.</h3> <p>Express yourself with next-level intelligent photo editing tools and an updated Image Playground, and save time in more of your favorite apps, including Photos, Messages, and Safari.<sup><a href=\"#footnote-2\" aria-label=\"Footnote 2\" data-modal-close=\"\">2</a></sup></p> </div> </div> <div data-analytics-section-engagement=\"name:child safety\"> <div> <picture id=\"overview-announced-child-safety-1\" data-lazy=\"\"> <source data-empty=\"\" srcset=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" media=\"(min-width:0px)\"> <img src=\"https://www.apple.com/v/apple-events/home/aj/images/overview/announced/child_safety__ct5cknewx6c2_large.jpg\" onload=\"window.__lp?.(event)\" alt=\"Adult and young child both engaged in content on iMac, blue\"> </picture> </div> <div> <h3>Easy, intuitive child safety protections.</h3> <p>New and expanded child safety features help make it easier for parents to keep kids safe online.</p> </div> </div> <div data-analytics-section-engagement=\"name:os improvements\"> <div> <picture id=\"overview-announced-os-improvements-1\" data-lazy=\"\"> <source data-empty=\"\" srcset=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" media=\"(min-width:0px)\"> <img src=\"https://www.apple.com/v/apple-events/home/aj/images/overview/announced/os_improvements__cp0dwydaxsuq_large.jpg\" onload=\"window.__lp?.(event)\" alt=\"Apple Mail is open to an astronomy newsletter, which promotes upcoming astronomy events and new science courses.\"> </picture> </div> <div> <h3>Tons of improvements all&nbsp;around.</h3> <p>Discover a wide range of performance enhancements that make your devices more responsive, reliable, and delightful to use.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <section data-analytics-section-engagement=\"name:past events\"> <p> <h2>View recent Apple Events</h2> </p> </section> <section data-analytics-activitymap-region-id=\"view all events\"> <p> <h2> <a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/channel/apple-events/id6442627105?hasPaidContent=false\" data-analytics-title=\"view all apple events\" aria-label=\"View all Apple Events\" data-analytics-exit-link=\"\"> <span>View all Apple Events</span> <span></span> </a> </h2> </p> </section>\n\t</div></div>",
